# BRAVADO: the eighth fight is the last: twelve random packs, already in
# the window, then the Pit Boss, for 3,200; there's no raising it. The
# boss drifts, fires fans of bullets and sends out pairs of fizzers that
# run at Dice and blow up (they don't count among those left). Beating it
# wins the fight and the run.
game bravado
wait 5
cheat run 1
cheat round 8
expect round == 8
expect groups == 12
expect prize == 3200
expect bad_groups == 0
expect shop_btn == 2
press LEFT
press A
expect groups == 12
expect prize == 3200
press RIGHT
press A
wait 2
expect state == 2
expect queued_7 == 1
expect boss_out == 0
cheat god
cheat skipq
waituntil boss_out == 1 200
expect queue_left == 0
expect enemies_left == 1
expect boss_hp == 400
waituntil eshots >= 7 600
waituntil foes_8 >= 2 900
expect enemies_left == 1
cheat killboss
wait 2
expect boss_dead == 1
expect foes == 0
expect state == 4
expect cash == 3200
expect won == 1
